routes 9
route 4 0 24
route 4 1 24
route 4 2 1.5
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 1 0.2 0.3 0.4 0.25
reverb 1 0.5 0.5 0.2
